      id: "5169",
      prompt: `Cedar Inc. reported a net income of $400,000. It had 100,000 shares of common stock outstanding all year and 10,000 shares of convertible preferred stock (convertible into 20,000 shares of common stock). The preferred dividends were $50,000. Using the if-converted method, what is Cedar Inc.'s diluted EPS?`,
